Which inline content a heading id is derived from

```
# a $`x` b
.
<section id="a-x-b">
  <h1>a <span class="math inline">\(x\)</span> b</h1>
</section>
```

```
# $`x`
.
<section id="x">
  <h1><span class="math inline">\(x\)</span></h1>
</section>
```

```
# a $$`x` b
.
<section id="a-x-b">
  <h1>a <span class="math display">\[x\]</span> b</h1>
</section>
```

```
# a `c` b
.
<section id="a-c-b">
  <h1>a <code>c</code> b</h1>
</section>
```

```
# a ![alt](i.png) b
.
<section id="a-alt-b">
  <h1>a <img src="i.png" alt="alt"> b</h1>
</section>
```

```
# a [link](/u) b
.
<section id="a-link-b">
  <h1>a <a href="/u">link</a> b</h1>
</section>
```

```
# a *[HTML]: x b
.
<section id="a-HTML-x-b">
  <h1>a *[HTML]: x b</h1>
</section>
```

```
# a {^up^} b
.
<section id="a-up-b">
  <h1>a <sup>up</sup> b</h1>
</section>
```

```
# a ^[note] b
.
<section id="a-b">
  <h1>a <a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a> b</h1>
</section>
<section role="doc-endnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>note<a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
## Target

# a </#Target> b
.
<section id="Target">
  <h2>Target</h2>
</section>
<section id="a-b">
  <h1>a <a href="#Target">Target</a> b</h1>
</section>
```

```
# a :smile: b
.
<section id="a-b">
  <h1>a :smile: b</h1>
</section>
```

```
# a %% c
.
<section id="a">
  <h1>a</h1>
</section>
```
